<title>ITALY: SPEED SKATING-WORLD CUP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SPEED SKATING-WORLD CUP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BASELGA DI PINE, Italy 1997-01-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading results</p>
<p>from World Cup speed skating races on Saturday:</p>
<p>Men's 1,500 metres:</p>
<p>1. Keiji Shirahata (Japan) one minute 52.32 seconds</p>
<p>2. Jeroen Straathof (Netherlands) 1:52.55</p>
<p>3. Hiroyuki Noake (Japan) 1:53.20</p>
<p>Standings:</p>
<p>1. Neal Marshall (Canada) 120 points</p>
<p>2. Ids Postma (Netherlands) 100</p>
<p>3. Rintje Ritsma (Netherlands) 85</p>
<p>Women's 1,500 metres:</p>
<p>1. Tonny De Jong (Netherlands) two minutes 04.94 seconds</p>
<p>2. Claudia Pechstein (Germany) 2:05.09</p>
<p>3. Svetlana Baschnova (Russia) 2:05.70</p>
<p>Standings:</p>
<p>1. De Jong 145</p>
<p>2. Kristin Holum (U.S.) 100</p>
<p>3. Gunda Niemann (Germany) 95</p>
